      "partKey": "part_welcome",
      "title": "MODULE 05 • COMPONENT ARCHITECTURE",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item active w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"WELCOME\" data-part-key=\"part_welcome\" id=\"slide-1\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card title-card-hero w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"title-hero-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] gap-4 items-center\">\n      <div class=\"title-text-col\">\n        <div class=\"title-badge-pill\">MODULE 05 • COMPONENT ARCHITECTURE</div>\n        <h1 class=\"title-main-h1 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 mb-1 leading-tight\">Shadcn UI<br><span class=\"title-accent text-blue-400 font-extrabold\">Accessible Component Architecture</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"title-tagline text-sm text-slate-300 italic m-0 mb-3\">“Beautifully designed components that you copy and paste into your apps”</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Learn how to architect accessible, customizable React component systems built on Radix UI primitives and Tailwind CSS.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"title-actions-row\"><button class=\"btn-cta-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 border border-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors no-underline\" id=\"btn-start-course\">Start Module <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></button><span class=\"cta-hint\">or press <kbd>Space</kbd> / <kbd>→</kbd></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"title-visual-col\">\n        <div class=\"terminal-mockup bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"terminal-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><div class=\"terminal-dots flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"dot red\"></span><span class=\"dot yellow\"></span><span class=\"dot green\"></span></div><span class=\"terminal-title text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold\">bash — add components</span></div><div class=\"terminal-body p-3 overflow-x-auto text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-mono text-xs\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term-prompt text-blue-500 select-none mr-2 font-bold\">$</span><span class=\"term-cmd text-blue-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5\">pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button card dialog</span></div><div class=\"term-output text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Installing dependencies: @radix-ui/react-slot, @radix-ui/react-dialog...<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Created components/ui/button.tsx<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Created components/ui/card.tsx<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Created components/ui/dialog.tsx<br><br><span class=\"out-success\">Success! 3 components added to your codebase.</span></div></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-2",
      "number": 2,
      "part": "OVERVIEW",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "What Makes Shadcn UI Different?",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"OVERVIEW\" id=\"slide-2\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">OVERVIEW</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">What Makes Shadcn UI Different?</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Why it is taking over the React and Next.js ecosystem</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"cross-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0L8 6.94l3.22-3.22a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06 1.06L9.06 8l3.22 3.22a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L8 9.06l-3.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L6.94 8 3.72 4.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></span> Traditional Component Libraries (MUI/Chakra)</h4>\n        <p>You install a massive npm package. Overriding styles is painful with complex CSS-in-JS wrappers. Upgrades break your custom designs.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>You are locked into their opinions and cannot easily modify internal component code.</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> The Shadcn UI Philosophy</h4>\n        <p>It is NOT an npm dependency. The source code lives directly inside your <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">src/components/ui/</code> directory. You own and customize every line.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Built on unstyled accessible Radix UI primitives and styled with standard Tailwind utility classes.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-3",
      "number": 3,
      "part": "ARCHITECTURE",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "The Three Pillars of Shadcn UI",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"ARCHITECTURE\" id=\"slide-3\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">ARCHITECTURE</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">The Three Pillars of Shadcn UI</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">How modern web building blocks unite</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"step-num-badge inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 text-[11px] font-bold font-mono bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-blue-400 shrink-0\">01</span> Radix UI Primitives</h4>\n        <p>Handles accessibility, keyboard navigation (Tab/Arrow keys), ARIA labels, focus trapping, and screen reader announcements.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"step-num-badge inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 text-[11px] font-bold font-mono bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-blue-400 shrink-0\">02</span> Tailwind CSS</h4>\n        <p>Provides utility styling, responsive breakpoints, dark mode variants, and smooth hover/active transitions.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4><span class=\"step-num-badge inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 text-[11px] font-bold font-mono bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-blue-400 shrink-0\">03</span> Lucide Icons</h4>\n        <p>Clean, lightweight, tree-shakeable SVG icons that integrate seamlessly with typography and buttons.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-4",
      "number": 4,
      "part": "SETUP",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Initializing Shadcn UI",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"SETUP\" id=\"slide-4\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">SETUP</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Initializing Shadcn UI</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Configuring components.json in your project</p></div>\n    <div class=\"terminal-mockup bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"terminal-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><div class=\"terminal-dots flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"dot red\"></span><span class=\"dot yellow\"></span><span class=\"dot green\"></span></div><span class=\"terminal-title text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold\">bash — init shadcn</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><div class=\"terminal-body p-3 overflow-x-auto text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-mono text-xs\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term-prompt text-blue-500 select-none mr-2 font-bold\">$</span><span class=\"term-cmd text-blue-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5\">pnpm dlx shadcn@latest init</span></div><div class=\"term-output text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Which style would you like to use? › New York<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Which color would you like to use as base color? › Zinc<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Would you like to use CSS variables for colors? › Yes<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Where is your global CSS file? › src/app/globals.css<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Configure the import alias for components: › @/components<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Configure the import alias for utils: › @/lib/utils<br><br><span class=\"out-success\">Success! Project initialized with components.json</span></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-5",
      "number": 5,
      "part": "UTILITIES",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "The cn() Utility &amp; Class Merging",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"UTILITIES\" id=\"slide-5\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">UTILITIES</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">The cn() Utility &amp; Class Merging</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Safely combining conditional classes and overriding Tailwind styles</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>src/lib/utils.ts</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">import { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\";\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\";\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs));\n}</code></pre></div>\n    <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">tailwind-merge</code> resolves Tailwind class conflicts intelligently. If a component defines <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-4</code> and the caller passes <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-6</code>, <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">p-6</code> wins cleanly instead of both classes fighting in CSS!</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-6",
      "number": 6,
      "part": "COMPONENTS",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Adding Components via CLI",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"COMPONENTS\" id=\"slide-6\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">COMPONENTS</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Adding Components via CLI</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Grabbing exactly what you need without dependency bloat</p></div>\n    <div class=\"terminal-mockup bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"terminal-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><div class=\"terminal-dots flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"dot red\"></span><span class=\"dot yellow\"></span><span class=\"dot green\"></span></div><span class=\"terminal-title text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold\">bash — add components</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><div class=\"terminal-body p-3 overflow-x-auto text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-mono text-xs\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term-prompt text-blue-500 select-none mr-2 font-bold\">$</span><span class=\"term-cmd text-blue-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5\">pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button badge card dialog</span></div><div class=\"term-output text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs\">Installing @radix-ui/react-slot @radix-ui/react-dialog...<br>Created src/components/ui/button.tsx<br>Created src/components/ui/badge.tsx<br>Created src/components/ui/card.tsx<br>Created src/components/ui/dialog.tsx<br><span class=\"out-success\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"inline-block align-middle mr-0.5\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg>Done! You can now import them into any page.</span></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-7",
      "number": 7,
      "part": "BUTTON",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "The Button Component &amp; Variants",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"BUTTON\" id=\"slide-7\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">BUTTON</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">The Button Component &amp; Variants</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Understanding class-variance-authority (cva)</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>Usage Example</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';\nimport { ArrowRight, Trash2 } from 'lucide-react';\n\nexport function ButtonShowcase() {\n  return (\n    &lt;div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 p-4\"&gt;\n      &lt;Button variant=\"default\"&gt;Primary Button&lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;Button variant=\"secondary\"&gt;Secondary&lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;Button variant=\"outline\"&gt;Outline&lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;Button variant=\"destructive\" size=\"sm\"&gt;\n        &lt;Trash2 className=\"w-4 h-4 mr-2\" /&gt; Delete\n      &lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;Button variant=\"default\" size=\"lg\"&gt;\n        Get Started &lt;ArrowRight className=\"w-4 h-4 ml-2\" /&gt;\n      &lt;/Button&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-8",
      "number": 8,
      "part": "CARD",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Card Component Architecture",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"CARD\" id=\"slide-8\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">CARD</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Card Component Architecture</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Composing headers, content, and actions semantically</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>components/ProjectCard.tsx</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">import { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter } from '@/components/ui/card';\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';\nimport { Badge } from '@/components/ui/badge';\n\nexport function ProjectCard() {\n  return (\n    &lt;Card className=\"w-full max-w-sm\"&gt;\n      &lt;CardHeader&gt;\n        &lt;div className=\"flex justify-between items-center\"&gt;\n          &lt;CardTitle&gt;Repository Sync&lt;/CardTitle&gt;\n          &lt;Badge variant=\"outline\"&gt;Active&lt;/Badge&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;CardDescription&gt;Last synchronized 2 minutes ago&lt;/CardDescription&gt;\n      &lt;/CardHeader&gt;\n      &lt;CardContent&gt;\n        &lt;p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\"&gt;Branches: main, feature-auth&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;/CardContent&gt;\n      &lt;CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\"&gt;\n        &lt;Button variant=\"outline\"&gt;View Details&lt;/Button&gt;\n        &lt;Button&gt;Sync Now&lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;/CardFooter&gt;\n    &lt;/Card&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-9",
      "number": 9,
      "part": "MODALS",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Accessible Dialogs &amp; Overlays",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"MODALS\" id=\"slide-9\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">MODALS</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Accessible Dialogs &amp; Overlays</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Full accessibility with focus traps and escape key handling</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>Dialog Example</span><button class=\"copy-btn text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors\">Copy</button></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">import { Dialog, DialogTrigger, DialogContent, DialogHeader, DialogTitle, DialogDescription } from '@/components/ui/dialog';\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';\n\nexport function DeleteRepoDialog() {\n  return (\n    &lt;Dialog&gt;\n      &lt;DialogTrigger asChild&gt;\n        &lt;Button variant=\"destructive\"&gt;Delete Project&lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;/DialogTrigger&gt;\n      &lt;DialogContent&gt;\n        &lt;DialogHeader&gt;\n          &lt;DialogTitle&gt;Are you absolutely sure?&lt;/DialogTitle&gt;\n          &lt;DialogDescription&gt;\n            This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your repository from the server.\n          &lt;/DialogDescription&gt;\n        &lt;/DialogHeader&gt;\n        &lt;div className=\"flex justify-end gap-3 mt-4\"&gt;\n          &lt;Button variant=\"outline\"&gt;Cancel&lt;/Button&gt;\n          &lt;Button variant=\"destructive\"&gt;Confirm Delete&lt;/Button&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/DialogContent&gt;\n    &lt;/Dialog&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-10",
      "number": 10,
      "part": "THEMING",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Theming &amp; CSS Variables",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"THEMING\" id=\"slide-10\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">THEMING</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Theming &amp; CSS Variables</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Effortless dark mode with design tokens</p></div>\n    <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>src/app/globals.css (Tokens)</span></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">:root {\n  --background: 0 0% 100%;\n  --foreground: 240 10% 3.9%;\n  --card: 0 0% 100%;\n  --primary: 240 5.9% 10%;\n  --primary-foreground: 0 0% 98%;\n  --radius: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.dark {\n  --background: 240 10% 3.9%;\n  --foreground: 0 0% 98%;\n  --card: 240 10% 5%;\n  --primary: 0 0% 98%;\n  --primary-foreground: 240 5.9% 10%;\n}</code></pre></div>\n    <div class=\"alert-callout tip flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed\"><div>Because components reference <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">bg-background</code> and <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">text-foreground</code>, toggling the <code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">dark</code> class changes the entire app's appearance seamlessly!</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-11",
      "number": 11,
      "part": "COMPOSITION",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Putting It Together: Full Widget",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"COMPOSITION\" id=\"slide-11\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">COMPOSITION</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\">Putting It Together: Full Widget</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">Composing multiple Shadcn components into a production UI</p></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-grid-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"code-box bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden font-mono text-xs shadow-md\"><div class=\"code-box-header flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800\"><span>DashboardWidget.tsx</span></div><pre><code class=\"font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-1.5 py-0.5\">export function DashboardWidget() {\n  return (\n    &lt;Card className=\"p-4 border-slate-800 bg-slate-900\"&gt;\n      &lt;div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"&gt;\n        &lt;Badge&gt;Production Ready&lt;/Badge&gt;\n        &lt;span className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\"&gt;v2.4.0&lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;h3 className=\"font-bold text-white text-lg\"&gt;Deploy Pipeline&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1\"&gt;Zero-config deployment with Git push&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div className=\"flex gap-2 mt-4\"&gt;\n        &lt;Button className=\"w-full\"&gt;Deploy Now&lt;/Button&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/Card&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre></div>\n      <div class=\"info-card bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-800 p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-2 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\">\n        <h4>Why This Architecture Wins</h4>\n        <p><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5 mr-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> Completely accessible out of the box</p>\n        <p><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5 mr-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> Code is stored in your repo, not node_modules</p>\n        <p><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5 mr-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> Zero runtime performance overhead</p>\n        <p><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5 mr-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span> Perfectly matches your custom design system</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-12",
      "number": 12,
      "part": "SUMMARY",
      "partKey": "",
      "title": "Slide 12",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide-item w-full max-w-7xl h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center\" data-part=\"SUMMARY\" id=\"slide-12\">\n  <div class=\"slide-content-card summary-card w-full max-w-7xl h-[80%] min-h-[80%] bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"slide-header-group flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 gap-3\"><span class=\"slide-category-tag font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400\">SUMMARY</span><h2 class=\"slide-title text-2xl font-extrabold text-white m-0 leading-tight\"><span class=\"inline-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mr-1 text-orange-400\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4 1.75C4 .784 4.784 0 5.75 0h4.5C11.216 0 12 .784 12 1.75V3h1.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 16 5.25v.5A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 12.75 9H11.9a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3.15 3.44v1.81h2a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-5.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h2v-1.81A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 4.1 9h-.85A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 0 5.75v-.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 3H4V1.75zm0 2.75H2.25a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 0 3.25 7.5H4V4.5zm8 3h.75a1.75 1.75 0 0 0 1.75-1.75v-.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75H12v3zM5.5 1.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25V8a2.75 2.75 0 1 0 5.5 0V1.75a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-5z\"/></svg></span>Curriculum Completed!</h2><p class=\"slide-subtitle text-[13px] text-slate-400 m-0\">You have traversed the complete modern web development stack</p></div>\n    <div class=\"summary-checklist-grid\">\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>01. Git:</strong> Local tracking, commits, branches, mental model</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>02. GitHub:</strong> Cloud repositories, remotes, push/pull, pull requests</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>03. Next.js:</strong> App Router, Server Components, SSR, API routes</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>04. Tailwind CSS:</strong> Utility classes, responsive design, dark mode</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>05. Shadcn UI:</strong> Radix primitives, accessible components, clean design</span></div>\n      <div class=\"checklist-item flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2.5 bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span class=\"check-icon inline-flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>Fullstack Readiness:</strong> From your first line of code to production!</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"quote-banner p-3 bg-slate-800/60 border-l-4 border-blue-500 text-slate-300 italic text-xs leading-relaxed\">Congratulations on completing the entire 5-module curriculum!</div>\n    <div class=\"mt-4 text-center\"><a href=\"../index.html\" class=\"btn-cta-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 border border-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer transition-colors no-underline\">Return to Curriculum Home <svg class=\"inline-arrow w-3 h-3 shrink-0 inline-block align-middle mx-1 text-slate-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.22 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.25 4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L9.94 8 6.22 4.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06z\"/></svg></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n      </div>"
